1
00:01:33,080 --> 00:01:38,229
[First Love Again]

2
00:01:38,410 --> 00:01:40,960
[Episode 16]

3
00:01:41,370 --> 00:01:43,300
How about we all have a drink first?

4
00:01:43,520 --> 00:01:45,520
-Sure.
-Come on. Let's have a drink.

5
00:01:45,520 --> 00:01:47,180
-Cheers!
-Thanks for coming.

6
00:01:48,800 --> 00:01:49,570
Sirui,

7
00:01:51,130 --> 00:01:52,520
you're celebrating your birthday
without inviting me?

8
00:01:52,520 --> 00:01:53,720
I only found out because Zhou Li told me.

9
00:01:53,720 --> 00:01:54,240
Hui, you are here.

10
00:01:54,240 --> 00:01:55,430
-Sorry, Hui.
-Hui.

11
00:01:55,450 --> 00:01:56,320
It was a last-minute get-together.

12
00:01:56,320 --> 00:01:57,280
-Come on, have a seat.
-Alright.

13
00:01:57,280 --> 00:01:57,950
Go ahead, sit down.

14
00:01:57,950 --> 00:01:58,810
Hey, everyone.

15
00:01:59,150 --> 00:02:00,090
Here's a gift for you.

16
00:02:00,090 --> 00:02:01,890
You brought me a gift? Thank you.

17
00:02:02,210 --> 00:02:03,940
Xiangxiang, you're here, too?

18
00:02:05,680 --> 00:02:07,050
What are you all waiting for?

19
00:02:07,050 --> 00:02:08,080
Come on, let's raise a glass
to the birthday boy!

20
00:02:08,080 --> 00:02:09,210
-Come on.
-Come on.

21
00:02:09,240 --> 00:02:09,800
-Come on.
-Happy birthday!

22
00:02:09,800 --> 00:02:10,930
Happy birthday, Sirui!

23
00:02:10,930 --> 00:02:12,330
-Happy birthday.
-Happy birthday.

24
00:02:12,330 --> 00:02:13,530
Thank you, everyone.

25
00:02:15,360 --> 00:02:17,890
Make yourselves at home.
Please, have a seat.

26
00:02:33,170 --> 00:02:33,850
Chen Yu,

27
00:02:34,450 --> 00:02:35,560
can you queue up "Chasing Dreams" for me?

28
00:02:35,560 --> 00:02:36,220
Sure thing.

29
00:02:36,450 --> 00:02:37,079
Hui,

30
00:02:37,210 --> 00:02:38,120
isn't this the song

31
00:02:38,120 --> 00:02:39,960
we used to sing
at our team-building events?

32
00:02:39,960 --> 00:02:41,290
Team-building events?

33
00:02:41,329 --> 00:02:42,860
You weren't here back then.

34
00:02:43,170 --> 00:02:44,240
I'll sing the first line.

35
00:02:44,240 --> 00:02:45,490
How does it go again?

36
00:02:45,490 --> 00:02:46,290
It's been ages since we last sang it.

37
00:02:46,290 --> 00:02:48,750
-Let's all sing together.
-Come on, come on!

38
00:02:52,240 --> 00:02:54,730
♪ The night sky when we first met ♪

39
00:02:54,840 --> 00:02:57,210
♪ The passion
has been engraved in my heart ♪

40
00:02:57,290 --> 00:02:58,210
Come on, Li Sirui.

41
00:02:58,210 --> 00:03:01,330
♪ White clothes are soaked in dreams ♪

42
00:03:02,360 --> 00:03:04,840
♪ In an instant, back to that time ♪

43
00:03:04,840 --> 00:03:07,450
♪ Outside the sports field,
the innocence of first sight ♪

44
00:03:07,520 --> 00:03:11,680
♪ Sunlight reflecting the thrill
of the arc ♪

45
00:03:11,730 --> 00:03:16,070
♪ Enjoy this touching moment ♪

46
00:03:14,170 --> 00:03:15,830
I'm going to use the restroom.

47
00:03:16,329 --> 00:03:20,520
♪ Forget the hesitation ♪

48
00:03:22,160 --> 00:03:25,600
♪ The sweat in my hair ♪

49
00:03:33,329 --> 00:03:34,930
Over the years, I've seen too many girls

50
00:03:34,930 --> 00:03:36,829
get hurt because they fell for him.

51
00:03:36,829 --> 00:03:38,230
Gu Han

52
00:03:38,890 --> 00:03:39,770
isn't the kind of guy

53
00:03:39,770 --> 00:03:41,680
who falls for someone easily,

54
00:03:42,450 --> 00:03:43,579
you know what I mean?

55
00:04:15,850 --> 00:04:17,250
I'll take you somewhere.

56
00:04:20,750 --> 00:04:25,110
[All Love Park Fairy Tale World]

57
00:04:31,170 --> 00:04:32,710
Why did you bring me here?

58
00:04:35,320 --> 00:04:37,240
[All Love Park Fairy Tale World]

59
00:04:36,130 --> 00:04:36,990
Do you remember

60
00:04:37,490 --> 00:04:38,490
saying you wanted

61
00:04:39,360 --> 00:04:41,890
to come to an amusement park
when we were kids?

62
00:04:43,610 --> 00:04:44,409
No, I don't.

63
00:04:47,570 --> 00:04:48,390
I do.

64
00:04:49,990 --> 00:04:51,720
And it was my birthday that day.

65
00:04:52,409 --> 00:04:53,290
My mom planned

66
00:04:53,290 --> 00:04:55,220
to come home and celebrate with me,

67
00:04:56,360 --> 00:04:57,690
but she never showed up.

68
00:04:58,970 --> 00:05:01,250
What did you wish for, Xiaoli?

69
00:05:01,410 --> 00:05:02,820
I wished

70
00:05:02,930 --> 00:05:05,530
that Mom could stay with me.

71
00:05:06,290 --> 00:05:07,730
I wished

72
00:05:07,730 --> 00:05:09,000
that one day,

73
00:05:09,000 --> 00:05:10,970
I could go to an amusement park
like the ones on TV,

74
00:05:10,970 --> 00:05:12,800
with a carousel.

75
00:05:13,360 --> 00:05:16,290
Someday, our wishes will come true.

76
00:05:28,530 --> 00:05:29,930
I was really sad that day,

77
00:05:30,710 --> 00:05:31,440
and you

78
00:05:31,960 --> 00:05:33,290
came over to comfort me.

79
00:05:38,409 --> 00:05:39,530
That's when

80
00:05:39,880 --> 00:05:40,650
I decided

81
00:05:41,290 --> 00:05:42,200
I'd bring you

82
00:05:43,090 --> 00:05:44,750
to an amusement park someday.

83
00:05:51,730 --> 00:05:52,320
Let's go.

84
00:05:55,790 --> 00:06:01,320
[All Love Park Fairy Tale World]

85
00:06:14,430 --> 00:06:15,630
Here, this is for you.

86
00:06:17,710 --> 00:06:18,440
What's this?

87
00:06:21,030 --> 00:06:22,240
It's a poem I was supposed
to write for you

88
00:06:22,090 --> 00:06:22,300
[Ru Meng Ling]

89
00:06:22,260 --> 00:06:23,550
for the Classical Chinese Literature
class.

90
00:06:22,300 --> 00:06:22,400
[In dreams, I return to a spring
of gentle rain and breeze.]

91
00:06:22,400 --> 00:06:22,510
[Behind jeweled curtains,
you slowly draw them open.]

92
00:06:22,530 --> 00:06:22,620
[Leaning close,
we count the blossoms in bloom.]

93
00:06:22,620 --> 00:06:22,720
[Spring is already halfway gone
since we parted.]

94
00:06:22,740 --> 00:06:22,890
[Who has seen it? Who has seen it?]

95
00:06:22,890 --> 00:06:23,040
[The courtyard of the little tower
we remember.]

96
00:06:25,860 --> 00:06:27,120
Tell me what you think.

97
00:06:38,050 --> 00:06:38,640
What,

98
00:06:39,380 --> 00:06:40,210
is it that bad?

99
00:06:42,330 --> 00:06:43,590
I'd rather not read it.

100
00:06:45,690 --> 00:06:47,020
Then I'll read it to you.

101
00:07:15,560 --> 00:07:19,200
♪ In dreams, I return to a spring
of gentle rain and breeze ♪

102
00:07:19,400 --> 00:07:22,840
♪ Behind jeweled curtains,
you slowly draw them open ♪

103
00:07:22,970 --> 00:07:25,050
♪ Leaning close,
we count the blossoms in bloom ♪

104
00:07:25,050 --> 00:07:27,000
♪ Spring is already halfway gone
since we parted ♪

105
00:07:27,000 --> 00:07:30,290
♪ Who has seen it?
Who has seen it? ♪

106
00:07:30,290 --> 00:07:33,800
♪ The courtyard of the little tower
we remember ♪

107
00:07:52,820 --> 00:07:58,470
♪ Whose heart is beating so fast? ♪

108
00:07:58,750 --> 00:08:02,350
♪ I'm trying to probe into her feelings ♪

109
00:08:02,850 --> 00:08:06,260
♪ When our eyes meet, I know deep inside ♪

110
00:08:07,010 --> 00:08:12,430
♪ Just like sparrow bickering ♪

111
00:08:12,460 --> 00:08:16,060
♪ It's caused by the emotions ♪

112
00:08:16,090 --> 00:08:20,200
♪ But our tacit understanding
is doubled secretly ♪

113
00:08:20,220 --> 00:08:22,690
♪ What happened? ♪

114
00:08:22,710 --> 00:08:29,820
♪ It seemed like destiny,
but it only backfired ♪

115
00:08:30,620 --> 00:08:33,909
♪ The more we separate,
the closer we'll get ♪

116
00:08:33,929 --> 00:08:36,750
♪ And the more fiercely
my heart will beat ♪

117
00:08:37,490 --> 00:08:41,659
♪ Love is the starry sky
that's waiting for someone ♪

118
00:08:42,030 --> 00:08:45,120
♪ Let's encounter the gentle breeze ♪

119
00:08:45,570 --> 00:08:48,770
♪ Let's hug when we meet again ♪

120
00:08:48,990 --> 00:08:51,170
♪ Just like the way we did in the past ♪

121
00:08:51,200 --> 00:08:54,060
♪ That was once my dream in my youth ♪

122
00:08:54,090 --> 00:08:57,650
♪ Time ebbs and flows, just like a dream ♪

123
00:08:57,680 --> 00:09:00,310
♪ By fate, it's as if ♪

124
00:09:01,060 --> 00:09:03,940
♪ I had been moved by you in every way ♪

125
00:09:02,650 --> 00:09:04,510
I thought you didn't like sweets.

126
00:09:04,890 --> 00:09:09,510
♪ You're the starry sky
that remains unchanged ♪

127
00:09:05,180 --> 00:09:05,770
I, uh...

128
00:09:07,500 --> 00:09:08,920
You seemed to be enjoying yours,

129
00:09:08,920 --> 00:09:10,040
so I wanted to try one.

130
00:09:09,530 --> 00:09:11,810
♪ And I'm the gentle breeze ♪

131
00:09:11,050 --> 00:09:12,170
So, do you like it?

132
00:09:11,830 --> 00:09:16,300
♪ Our hearts are pounding
when we meet again ♪

133
00:09:14,560 --> 00:09:15,220
It's sweet.

134
00:09:16,320 --> 00:09:19,990
♪ We can empathize with each other ♪

135
00:09:20,020 --> 00:09:24,500
♪ In the morning, at dusk
and in the afternoon, we can hold hands ♪

136
00:09:24,530 --> 00:09:27,960
♪ I'll kiss your forehead ♪

137
00:09:27,990 --> 00:09:30,340
♪ The reason
for my most certain happiness ♪

138
00:09:30,370 --> 00:09:33,940
♪ Is the gentleness of first love ♪

139
00:09:39,360 --> 00:09:40,360
Zhou Xiangxiang,

140
00:09:46,260 --> 00:09:47,150
I like you.

141
00:09:47,670 --> 00:09:50,780
♪ I love you ♪

142
00:09:51,050 --> 00:09:54,910
♪ I miss you ♪

143
00:09:55,110 --> 00:10:02,290
♪ The me who met you that day
belongs to long, long ago ♪

144
00:10:02,800 --> 00:10:05,980
♪ Across the sea of time ♪

145
00:10:06,210 --> 00:10:10,720
♪ Reunited,
love finds its sweetest scene ♪

146
00:10:10,850 --> 00:10:17,070
♪ Loving you, I'll never change ♪

147
00:10:22,440 --> 00:10:23,440
Attention, visitors.

148
00:10:23,440 --> 00:10:24,250
The game is over.

149
00:10:24,250 --> 00:10:27,110
Please take all your belongings
and leave the area.

150
00:11:02,130 --> 00:11:03,130
H-Here, this way.

151
00:11:57,960 --> 00:11:58,820
Your seat belt.

152
00:12:56,930 --> 00:12:57,590
We're here.

153
00:13:02,250 --> 00:13:03,130
Um...

154
00:13:04,050 --> 00:13:05,250
I'll head back first.

155
00:13:06,950 --> 00:13:08,270
Be safe.

156
00:13:34,660 --> 00:13:35,660
Zhou Xiangxiang,

157
00:13:38,680 --> 00:13:39,720
I like you.

158
00:13:51,450 --> 00:13:52,670
[Gu Han]

159
00:14:07,340 --> 00:14:09,620
[Zhou Xiangxiang]

160
00:14:14,900 --> 00:14:15,850
[Are you asleep?]

161
00:14:17,910 --> 00:14:19,030
[Are you asleep?]

162
00:14:19,050 --> 00:14:21,210
[Not yet.]

163
00:14:23,120 --> 00:14:24,950
[Zhou Xiangxiang]

164
00:14:28,050 --> 00:14:29,920
[What happened just now...]

165
00:14:31,720 --> 00:14:33,470
[Typing...]

166
00:14:37,850 --> 00:14:39,000
[Just now, you...]

167
00:14:45,530 --> 00:14:46,570
[Typing...]

168
00:14:50,130 --> 00:14:53,110
[Are we boyfriend and girlfriend now?]

169
00:14:59,420 --> 00:15:01,250
[Gu Han]

170
00:15:06,600 --> 00:15:08,920
[So, what's your answer?]

171
00:15:12,640 --> 00:15:13,070
[Gu Han]

172
00:15:13,090 --> 00:15:14,630
[So, what's your answer?]

173
00:15:20,500 --> 00:15:20,950
[Zhou Xiangxiang]

174
00:15:20,970 --> 00:15:21,750
[Typing...]

175
00:15:27,590 --> 00:15:29,540
[I'd love to be your girlfriend.]

176
00:15:29,620 --> 00:15:30,170
[Typing...]

177
00:15:30,170 --> 00:15:31,670
[Zhou Xiangxiang]

178
00:15:36,950 --> 00:15:37,160
[Zhou Xiangxiang]

179
00:15:37,180 --> 00:15:38,260
[Typing...]

180
00:15:39,720 --> 00:15:43,010
[Will you be my boyfriend?]

181
00:15:50,140 --> 00:15:52,370
[We're officially together]

182
00:15:57,910 --> 00:15:59,580
[Okay.]

183
00:16:20,130 --> 00:16:20,930
Oh my God,

184
00:16:20,930 --> 00:16:23,250
you've known each other
for over ten years!

185
00:16:23,250 --> 00:16:25,410
You can't count it like that.

186
00:16:25,410 --> 00:16:27,290
We lost touch after he left
in elementary school,

187
00:16:27,290 --> 00:16:29,080
and didn't reconnect until college.

188
00:16:29,080 --> 00:16:30,560
So you two are childhood sweethearts

189
00:16:30,560 --> 00:16:32,600
who found each other again?

190
00:16:33,600 --> 00:16:35,800
That's so romantic!

191
00:16:35,840 --> 00:16:37,260
Confetti! Confetti!

192
00:16:37,440 --> 00:16:38,440
Congratulations!

193
00:16:38,440 --> 00:16:40,510
Another girl in our dorm
is officially taken!

194
00:16:40,510 --> 00:16:42,410
Xiangxiang, what are your plans?

195
00:16:42,410 --> 00:16:43,890
What plans could she have?

196
00:16:43,890 --> 00:16:45,840
You, just don't get
all lovey-dovey all the time.

197
00:16:45,840 --> 00:16:47,200
Remember us, too.

198
00:16:48,170 --> 00:16:51,170
It's just a relationship.
Is it really that big a deal?

199
00:16:53,200 --> 00:16:54,010
I don't think

200
00:16:54,010 --> 00:16:54,960
I'm any different

201
00:16:54,960 --> 00:16:56,170
from how I usually am.

202
00:16:56,440 --> 00:16:57,250
Besides,

203
00:16:57,480 --> 00:16:58,600
I'm

204
00:16:58,600 --> 00:17:00,370
a pretty low-key person.

205
00:17:03,560 --> 00:17:06,220
I've got plans with someone,
so I'm heading out.

206
00:17:24,240 --> 00:17:25,000
Captain,

207
00:17:25,790 --> 00:17:27,280
where did you whisk Xiangxiang

208
00:17:27,280 --> 00:17:28,280
off to last night?

209
00:17:30,960 --> 00:17:32,520
Looks like
there's no juicy gossip after all.

210
00:17:32,520 --> 00:17:33,410
Xiaotao said

211
00:17:33,410 --> 00:17:35,740
Xiangxiang got back to the dorm room
pretty early last night.

212
00:17:35,740 --> 00:17:37,300
Then you're doing it wrong!

213
00:17:37,410 --> 00:17:38,840
With an opportunity like that,

214
00:17:38,840 --> 00:17:40,370
shouldn't you have eloped?

215
00:17:40,410 --> 00:17:41,480
Eloped?

216
00:17:41,480 --> 00:17:42,570
No way!

217
00:17:42,570 --> 00:17:44,570
If he eloped, we'd lose our captain!

218
00:17:48,330 --> 00:17:48,930
Morning.

219
00:17:48,930 --> 00:17:49,480
Morning.

220
00:17:50,130 --> 00:17:52,370
Xiangxiang, you weren't
very nice last night.

221
00:17:52,370 --> 00:17:53,330
It's my birthday only once a year.

222
00:17:53,330 --> 00:17:54,930
Why'd you sneak off so early?

223
00:17:55,240 --> 00:17:56,240
Sorry about that.

224
00:17:56,810 --> 00:17:58,890
Did something happen?

225
00:17:59,410 --> 00:18:00,720
Yeah, care to explain?

226
00:18:03,440 --> 00:18:05,370
Why did you ask me to come to the gym?

227
00:18:11,810 --> 00:18:12,520
Everyone,

228
00:18:13,720 --> 00:18:15,180
I've got an announcement.

229
00:18:15,930 --> 00:18:16,720
Xiangxiang

230
00:18:17,440 --> 00:18:18,640
is my girlfriend now.

231
00:18:20,760 --> 00:18:21,440
Really?

232
00:18:21,440 --> 00:18:22,930
You told me yesterday,
but I didn't believe you!

233
00:18:22,930 --> 00:18:23,810
-Seriously?
-Is it true?

234
00:18:23,810 --> 00:18:24,870
I don't believe it.

235
00:18:27,480 --> 00:18:28,930
-Is it true?
-It's true!

236
00:18:30,720 --> 00:18:32,750
You two got together behind our backs?

237
00:18:32,750 --> 00:18:34,090
Keeping us all in the dark, huh?

238
00:18:34,090 --> 00:18:35,290
Thanks, sis-in-law!

239
00:18:35,650 --> 00:18:38,070
Our captain has finally found love!

240
00:18:38,480 --> 00:18:39,480
Bro! Sis-in-law!

241
00:18:39,650 --> 00:18:40,570
Congratulations!

242
00:18:40,570 --> 00:18:41,810
-Congratulations!
-Congratulations, sister-in-law.

243
00:18:41,810 --> 00:18:42,930
-Congratulations, Captain.
-Congratulations.

244
00:18:42,930 --> 00:18:44,090
-Congratulations, Captain.
-Congratulations.

245
00:18:44,090 --> 00:18:45,150
Congratulations.

246
00:18:45,200 --> 00:18:46,410
-Alright, enough.
-Congratulations.

247
00:18:46,410 --> 00:18:47,810
Quick, get a chair for our sis-in-law.

248
00:18:47,810 --> 00:18:48,440
Right!

249
00:18:53,680 --> 00:18:54,580
Here, sis-in-law.

250
00:18:54,580 --> 00:18:55,480
Have some more. Eat up!

251
00:18:55,480 --> 00:18:57,010
Come on, sit down, sit down.

252
00:18:58,650 --> 00:19:00,450
Sis-in-law, here's some water.

253
00:19:01,000 --> 00:19:02,760
Can you guys stop calling me sis-in-law?

254
00:19:02,760 --> 00:19:04,200
You're our sis-in-law now.

255
00:19:04,200 --> 00:19:05,480
-Don't be so modest, sis-in-law.
-Right?

256
00:19:05,480 --> 00:19:06,040
-Sister-in-law.
-Sister-in-law.

257
00:19:06,040 --> 00:19:06,990
-Sister-in-law.
-Sister-in-law.

258
00:19:06,990 --> 00:19:08,570
-Sister-in-law.
-Sister-in-law.

259
00:19:08,570 --> 00:19:10,610
-Sister-in-law.
-Sister-in-law.

260
00:19:21,670 --> 00:19:22,480
What's wrong?

261
00:19:24,040 --> 00:19:25,850
Was it bad that I told everyone

262
00:19:26,130 --> 00:19:27,130
about us just now?

263
00:19:27,520 --> 00:19:28,680
No.

264
00:19:30,680 --> 00:19:31,810
I was just thinking,

265
00:19:32,000 --> 00:19:34,610
people say couples
who show off their love don't last long.

266
00:19:34,610 --> 00:19:35,680
Since we just got together,

267
00:19:35,680 --> 00:19:37,740
maybe we should keep things low-key?

268
00:19:39,370 --> 00:19:40,700
Sure. Whatever you say.

269
00:19:42,330 --> 00:19:43,390
Someone's coming.

270
00:19:49,040 --> 00:19:50,440
What's going on with you two?

271
00:19:50,440 --> 00:19:52,700
-We're going to eat.
-We're going to eat.

272
00:19:53,960 --> 00:19:54,570
Let's go.

273
00:19:55,950 --> 00:19:56,800
Xiangxiang.

274
00:20:09,480 --> 00:20:10,540
I'll have this one.

275
00:20:13,500 --> 00:20:14,560
I'll have this one.

276
00:20:14,570 --> 00:20:15,250
Okay.

277
00:20:15,440 --> 00:20:16,040
Thank you.

278
00:20:18,370 --> 00:20:18,930
Here.

279
00:20:20,410 --> 00:20:21,040
This one.

280
00:20:21,440 --> 00:20:22,100
Here you go.

281
00:20:22,570 --> 00:20:23,170
Okay.

282
00:20:28,040 --> 00:20:29,370
What are those two up to?

283
00:20:30,960 --> 00:20:34,020
They're on the same page
about keeping things low-key.

284
00:21:00,500 --> 00:21:01,210
The drink.

285
00:21:09,440 --> 00:21:10,050
Eat up.

286
00:21:51,570 --> 00:21:52,280
I can't take this anymore.

287
00:21:52,280 --> 00:21:53,040
Let's go.

288
00:22:13,900 --> 00:22:15,760
We're off tomorrow. Wanna go out?

289
00:22:16,570 --> 00:22:17,200
Sure.

290
00:22:27,200 --> 00:22:29,200
So the girl Gu Han has loved for years

291
00:22:29,620 --> 00:22:30,870
is Zhou Xiangxiang?

292
00:22:31,200 --> 00:22:32,480
What are the odds!

293
00:22:33,170 --> 00:22:34,200
You bet.

294
00:22:34,200 --> 00:22:36,380
Remember how Gu Han kept
picking on Xiangxiang

295
00:22:36,380 --> 00:22:37,780
when they first met?

296
00:22:38,000 --> 00:22:38,840
I bet

297
00:22:38,860 --> 00:22:41,390
he was just trying
to get close to Xiangxiang.

298
00:22:42,320 --> 00:22:45,250
They keep saying
they're gonna keep things low-key,

299
00:22:45,440 --> 00:22:48,000
but they're practically
shoving their love in everyone's faces.

300
00:22:48,000 --> 00:22:49,050
I'm gonna die from all the PDA.

301
00:22:49,050 --> 00:22:49,920
Exactly.

302
00:23:01,410 --> 00:23:02,760
Well, how does it look?

303
00:23:03,680 --> 00:23:05,280
You'd look good in anything.

304
00:23:17,070 --> 00:23:17,750
Thanks.

305
00:23:20,680 --> 00:23:21,330
Let's go.

306
00:23:21,330 --> 00:23:22,660
Aren't you gonna buy it?

307
00:23:22,930 --> 00:23:24,330
Money's a little tight
at the end of the month.

308
00:23:24,330 --> 00:23:25,930
I'll come back next month

309
00:23:25,960 --> 00:23:27,760
after Dad gives me my allowance.

310
00:23:28,330 --> 00:23:30,410
By the way, where's the restroom?

311
00:23:31,000 --> 00:23:32,200
Go through that door, turn right,

312
00:23:32,200 --> 00:23:33,650
and walk all the way to the end.

313
00:23:33,650 --> 00:23:34,280
Thanks.

314
00:23:35,000 --> 00:23:36,480
I'm gonna use the restroom.

315
00:23:36,480 --> 00:23:38,000
You can sit here. It's cooler.

316
00:23:38,000 --> 00:23:39,090
Sure, go ahead.

317
00:23:46,000 --> 00:23:46,480
Hi.

318
00:23:46,480 --> 00:23:48,040
How much was the bag

319
00:23:48,040 --> 00:23:48,840
my girlfriend just asked about?

320
00:23:48,840 --> 00:23:50,120
This one is 870 yuan.

321
00:23:51,720 --> 00:23:53,370
870 yuan for such a tiny bag?

322
00:23:53,480 --> 00:23:55,040
It's actually the cheapest one

323
00:23:55,040 --> 00:23:56,300
in our new collection.

324
00:24:04,950 --> 00:24:06,150
That's so expensive.

325
00:24:11,800 --> 00:24:13,020
I'll take it. Please wrap it up.

326
00:24:13,020 --> 00:24:13,930
Of course, sir.

327
00:24:18,580 --> 00:24:20,220
[Account Balance: 3,762.13 yuan]

328
00:24:20,520 --> 00:24:21,770
870 yuan...

329
00:24:23,080 --> 00:24:24,720
[My WeChat Balance: 1,976 yuan]

330
00:24:30,150 --> 00:24:31,130
I'll pay with WeChat.

331
00:24:31,130 --> 00:24:32,860
You can just scan the code here.

332
00:24:34,790 --> 00:24:36,060
[Yu'E Bao Balance]

333
00:24:45,610 --> 00:24:46,440
I'm back.

334
00:24:46,440 --> 00:24:47,170
You're back?

335
00:24:54,370 --> 00:24:55,420
Did you buy a bag?

336
00:24:55,930 --> 00:24:56,960
Li Sirui got it for me.

337
00:24:56,960 --> 00:24:59,410
He said the company where he's interning
just gave him a bonus.

338
00:24:59,410 --> 00:25:00,810
Sirui sure is generous.

339
00:25:00,850 --> 00:25:01,480
Not bad.

340
00:25:01,620 --> 00:25:03,290
He's a keeper.

341
00:25:05,000 --> 00:25:06,930
Then you'd better hurry up
and make your move.

342
00:25:06,930 --> 00:25:08,720
Why are you dragging me into this?

343
00:25:08,720 --> 00:25:10,330
You and Chen Yu...

344
00:25:10,650 --> 00:25:11,520
You're back?

345
00:25:11,890 --> 00:25:12,760
Perfect timing.

346
00:25:12,760 --> 00:25:13,650
Help me decide

347
00:25:13,650 --> 00:25:14,980
which one looks better.

348
00:25:15,130 --> 00:25:16,610
It's just a date.

349
00:25:16,610 --> 00:25:18,480
It's not like it's your first time
seeing each other.

350
00:25:18,480 --> 00:25:20,480
But it is our first date.

351
00:25:21,930 --> 00:25:23,960
So much for keeping things low-key.

352
00:25:25,960 --> 00:25:27,240
I think the white one looks better.

353
00:25:27,240 --> 00:25:28,130
Really?

354
00:25:28,650 --> 00:25:29,890
I think so, too.

355
00:25:30,170 --> 00:25:31,370
I'll go with that one.

356
00:25:32,130 --> 00:25:34,280
Have you picked a place for your date yet?

357
00:25:34,280 --> 00:25:35,090
Not yet.

358
00:25:35,720 --> 00:25:37,980
You can't go on a date
without a good spot!

359
00:25:38,290 --> 00:25:39,610
I've got just the place.

360
00:25:39,610 --> 00:25:41,170
It's perfect for dates.

361
00:25:41,170 --> 00:25:42,570
Great! Send it to me.

362
00:26:19,880 --> 00:26:24,670
[Jiangcheng University]

363
00:26:35,010 --> 00:26:37,230
[Jiangcheng University]

364
00:26:58,360 --> 00:26:59,490
Hey, sis-in-law!

365
00:27:00,130 --> 00:27:00,860
Sis-in-law!

366
00:27:01,930 --> 00:27:03,090
Didn't I tell you

367
00:27:03,090 --> 00:27:04,440
to stop calling me that?

368
00:27:05,230 --> 00:27:07,690
Sis-in-law's waiting here for the captain.

369
00:27:08,570 --> 00:27:10,970
How can the captain be late
for his own date?

370
00:27:11,330 --> 00:27:12,130
I'm off.

371
00:27:12,280 --> 00:27:14,230
Xiangxiang, you look different today.

372
00:27:14,230 --> 00:27:14,910
Really?

373
00:27:16,600 --> 00:27:17,730
You've got a pimple.

374
00:27:29,710 --> 00:27:30,440
Xiangxiang.

375
00:27:31,970 --> 00:27:33,630
I'm sorry, I'm sorry I'm late.

376
00:27:35,000 --> 00:27:35,850
It's okay.

377
00:27:37,650 --> 00:27:39,580
You look a little different today.

378
00:27:40,810 --> 00:27:42,760
-I've got a—
-This basketball earring

379
00:27:42,760 --> 00:27:43,820
looks great on you.

380
00:27:52,200 --> 00:27:52,850
Let's go.

381
00:27:54,570 --> 00:27:55,630
Where are we going?

382
00:27:55,930 --> 00:27:57,330
Xiaotao told me

383
00:27:57,330 --> 00:27:58,650
about a place
that's popular on social media.

384
00:27:58,650 --> 00:27:59,240
Okay.

385
00:28:04,540 --> 00:28:06,270
Let's take a picture together.

386
00:28:07,370 --> 00:28:08,800
I'm not very good at taking pictures.

387
00:28:08,800 --> 00:28:09,830
It's okay.

388
00:28:09,850 --> 00:28:12,780
We don't get to go out
and have fun like this every day.

389
00:28:19,370 --> 00:28:21,100
Doesn't this look pretty good?

390
00:28:27,040 --> 00:28:29,040
There's something I want to ask you.

391
00:28:29,200 --> 00:28:29,810
Okay.

392
00:28:34,000 --> 00:28:36,330
Why did your whole family

393
00:28:36,930 --> 00:28:38,990
leave Kunzhou so suddenly back then?

394
00:28:42,000 --> 00:28:44,400
It's okay if you don't want
to talk about it.

395
00:28:45,400 --> 00:28:46,080
It's fine.

396
00:28:47,680 --> 00:28:48,940
I was little back then.

397
00:28:49,850 --> 00:28:53,110
I didn't find out we were moving
until the very last minute.

398
00:28:53,630 --> 00:28:55,100
My mom's always been like that.

399
00:28:55,100 --> 00:28:56,890
She makes all the decisions herself

400
00:28:56,890 --> 00:28:58,620
and never considers how I feel.

401
00:29:06,130 --> 00:29:08,060
I'm sorry. I shouldn't have asked.

402
00:29:10,060 --> 00:29:10,660
It's okay.

403
00:29:10,890 --> 00:29:12,170
I can tell you about it.

404
00:29:14,340 --> 00:29:16,180
Let's put all that aside for now

405
00:29:16,200 --> 00:29:17,660
and just enjoy ourselves.

406
00:29:19,370 --> 00:29:20,000
Let's go.

407
00:29:23,570 --> 00:29:29,220
♪ Whose heart is beating so fast? ♪

408
00:29:24,140 --> 00:29:25,910
[Time Photo Studio]

409
00:29:26,150 --> 00:29:27,150
Stand right here.

410
00:29:28,470 --> 00:29:29,140
Here?

411
00:29:29,500 --> 00:29:33,100
♪ I'm trying to probe into her feelings ♪

412
00:29:33,600 --> 00:29:37,130
♪ When our eyes meet, I know deep inside ♪

413
00:29:37,690 --> 00:29:38,860
Which one looks better?

414
00:29:37,760 --> 00:29:43,180
♪ Just like sparrow bickering ♪

415
00:29:42,410 --> 00:29:43,060
This one.

416
00:29:43,210 --> 00:29:46,810
♪ It's caused by the emotions ♪

417
00:29:46,840 --> 00:29:50,950
♪ But our tacit understanding
is doubled secretly ♪

418
00:29:51,190 --> 00:29:55,810
♪ You're the starry sky
that remains unchanged ♪

419
00:29:55,830 --> 00:29:58,110
♪ And I'm the gentle breeze ♪

420
00:29:58,130 --> 00:30:02,600
♪ Our hearts are pounding
when we meet again ♪

421
00:30:02,620 --> 00:30:06,290
♪ We can empathize with each other ♪

422
00:30:06,320 --> 00:30:10,800
♪ In the morning, at dusk
and in the afternoon, we can hold hands ♪

423
00:30:10,830 --> 00:30:14,260
♪ I'll kiss your forehead ♪

424
00:30:14,290 --> 00:30:16,640
♪ The reason
for my most certain happiness ♪

425
00:30:16,670 --> 00:30:20,240
♪ Is the gentleness of first love ♪

426
00:30:21,140 --> 00:30:22,300
At least you have a conscience.

427
00:30:22,300 --> 00:30:23,910
You got a boyfriend,
but you haven't forgotten your roommates.

428
00:30:23,910 --> 00:30:25,710
How could I ever forget you guys?

429
00:30:25,720 --> 00:30:27,130
Congrats!

430
00:30:27,130 --> 00:30:29,240
Your first date was so sweet.

431
00:30:30,270 --> 00:30:31,430
Okay, okay,

432
00:30:31,850 --> 00:30:33,110
I'll stop teasing you.

433
00:30:33,520 --> 00:30:34,960
But seriously,

434
00:30:34,960 --> 00:30:36,040
now that you've held hands,

435
00:30:36,040 --> 00:30:37,960
isn't it time to take things
to the next level?

436
00:30:37,960 --> 00:30:39,370
What next level?

437
00:30:39,760 --> 00:30:41,410
Show everyone he's taken!

438
00:30:41,680 --> 00:30:43,930
Let all those girls
who are after him back off.

439
00:30:43,930 --> 00:30:44,610
Don't forget,

440
00:30:44,610 --> 00:30:47,130
your boyfriend is JCU's campus heartthrob.

441
00:30:47,810 --> 00:30:49,610
H-How do I do that?

442
00:30:52,280 --> 00:30:53,130
Easy.

443
00:30:53,200 --> 00:30:54,810
Change your WeChat profile pictures
to matching profile pictures,

444
00:30:54,810 --> 00:30:56,850
set each other's photos
as your phone wallpapers,

445
00:30:56,850 --> 00:30:59,450
use each other's birthdays
as your passcodes,

446
00:30:59,570 --> 00:31:00,890
post more pictures together on Moments,

447
00:31:00,890 --> 00:31:02,440
and show off your relationship in public
whenever you get the chance.

448
00:31:02,440 --> 00:31:04,240
No rush, no rush. One step at a time.

449
00:31:04,240 --> 00:31:05,480
What's the first thing?

450
00:31:05,480 --> 00:31:06,720
Matching profile pictures.

451
00:31:06,720 --> 00:31:07,570
I think the first step

452
00:31:07,570 --> 00:31:09,480
should be posting a picture together
on Moments.

453
00:31:09,480 --> 00:31:11,480
But she should change
their profile pictures first.

454
00:31:11,480 --> 00:31:13,360
Why not do both?

455
00:31:13,410 --> 00:31:14,410
Sounds good.

456
00:31:14,570 --> 00:31:15,810
Then change their passcodes.

457
00:31:15,810 --> 00:31:17,330
And their Moments cover photos.

458
00:31:17,330 --> 00:31:17,940
Exactly!

459
00:31:17,960 --> 00:31:19,040
Exactly!

460
00:31:36,000 --> 00:31:37,440
I sent you this for your profile picture.

461
00:31:37,440 --> 00:31:38,970
Come on, change it already.

462
00:31:58,650 --> 00:32:01,380
Why haven't you changed it yet?
Don't you like it?

463
00:32:07,680 --> 00:32:08,870
[Uploading profile picture...]

464
00:32:12,060 --> 00:32:13,630
[Gu Han]

465
00:32:18,310 --> 00:32:20,870
[Jiangcheng University Basketball Team]

466
00:32:22,570 --> 00:32:23,410
Whoa!

467
00:32:24,960 --> 00:32:25,930
Sirui, Sirui!

468
00:32:25,930 --> 00:32:26,570
Look!

469
00:32:27,240 --> 00:32:27,890
What is it?

470
00:32:27,920 --> 00:32:29,680
The captain changed his profile picture!

471
00:32:29,680 --> 00:32:30,480
No way.

472
00:32:30,480 --> 00:32:32,130
He hasn't changed it in three years.

473
00:32:32,130 --> 00:32:32,930
He really did!

474
00:32:33,240 --> 00:32:35,700
You don't wanna use a dog
as your profile pic.

475
00:32:35,760 --> 00:32:36,930
Actually, it suits me.

476
00:32:36,930 --> 00:32:39,200
This little puppy and me—
we're both single.

477
00:32:39,200 --> 00:32:40,200
I know why.

478
00:32:41,280 --> 00:32:42,410
He wants to get a dog.

479
00:32:43,760 --> 00:32:44,720
He's terrified of dogs.

480
00:32:44,720 --> 00:32:45,850
Why would he get one?

481
00:32:46,410 --> 00:32:47,170
Let me see.

482
00:32:47,810 --> 00:32:49,470
These are matching profile pictures.

483
00:32:49,470 --> 00:32:50,670
He's dating someone.

484
00:32:51,040 --> 00:32:52,750
[Jiangcheng University Basketball Team]

485
00:32:51,200 --> 00:32:52,090
It makes sense.

486
00:32:53,440 --> 00:32:54,640
Having fun chatting?

487
00:32:54,890 --> 00:32:55,860
Let's shoot some hoops.

488
00:32:55,860 --> 00:32:57,120
Loser buys the drinks.

489
00:33:01,220 --> 00:33:01,810
-I'm out.
-I'm out.

490
00:33:01,810 --> 00:33:02,870
-I'm out.
-I'm out.

491
00:33:04,720 --> 00:33:05,170
Come on.

492
00:33:05,170 --> 00:33:05,830
Let's do it!

493
00:33:11,990 --> 00:33:14,100
[Jiangcheng University Basketball Team]

494
00:33:13,330 --> 00:33:14,410
Everyone, gather around.

495
00:33:14,410 --> 00:33:15,000
Come on, come on.

496
00:33:15,000 --> 00:33:15,850
Hui.

497
00:33:16,650 --> 00:33:17,280
Hui.

498
00:33:17,890 --> 00:33:18,410
Hui.

499
00:33:18,440 --> 00:33:19,510
-Hui.
-Hui.

500
00:33:19,240 --> 00:33:25,540
[Jiangcheng University Basketball Team]

501
00:33:19,760 --> 00:33:20,370
Hui.

502
00:33:21,410 --> 00:33:23,810
There's something I need to tell everyone.

503
00:33:24,520 --> 00:33:25,750
Tang Hui

504
00:33:26,250 --> 00:33:27,810
won't be able to compete with us
in the national tournament.
